{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22874","headline":"元和十三年淮寇未平诏停岁仗愤然有感率尔成章 · 白居易","name":"元和十三年淮寇未平诏停岁仗愤然有感率尔成章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻停岁仗轸皇情，应爲淮西寇未平。\n不分气从歌里发，无明心向酒中生。\n愚计忽思飞短檄，狂心便欲请长缨。\n从来妄动多如此，自笑何曾得事成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}